Based on the code provided, specifically the `max_active` function:

```rust
pub(super) fn max_active(loaded: &Loaded) -> usize {
    let Engine::Qwen35Cuda(_) = &loaded.model else {
        return 1; // <--- This line executes if the model is NOT Qwen3.5 on CUDA
    };
    // ... rest of the logic
}
```

When the model is **not** `Qwen35Cuda`, the function immediately returns **`1`**.

This is explicitly stated in the comment above the function as well:
> "Anything but Qwen3.5 on CUDA runs one request."
